===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*sem-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|syllable}}, {{m|enm|sillable}}, {{m|enm|syllabylle}}, {{m|enm|sylabul}}, from {{der|en|xno|sillable}}, from {{der|en|fro|sillebe}}, from {{der|en|la|syllaba}}, from {{der|en|grc|συλλαβή|}}, from {{m|grc|συλλαμβάνω||I gather together}}, from {{m|grc|συν-||together}} + {{m|grc|λαμβάνω||I take}}.

